{"ID":"20240513083100-mvjh9zs","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083100-mvjh9zs","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083100-mvjh9zs\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513164010-ozbe4o9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513164010-ozbe4o9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:200,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513164010-ozbe4o9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:337,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:337\u0026#125;","title":"243","type":"doc","updated":"20240514162212"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513164010-ozbe4o9","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 829px;","id":"20240513164010-ozbe4o9","updated":"20240514162212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/4/23"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"193-4 H, L"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"男"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"52/瘦;中型"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/5/5"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因：1. 宿矢未出;"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服藥之後,"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 小便: 中黃, 色退些"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 大便: 次數增加,小塊狀; 服HT-43號後,大便有油狀(一日7,8次)量少"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 上完廁所後,肛門仍脹滿"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、 噁心: 無"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、 往來寒熱: 無"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、 睡時體溫: 身偏熱, 雙足較冷,手暖和了"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、 口渴: 有, 口唇乾, 但不想喝水"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診： 洪大, 有力"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、舌診：淡白濕 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、眼診：N/A"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 陽明病"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 同4/28方 加 赤小豆五錢("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"斂濕"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":") 當歸二錢("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"潤腸助便"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":") 丹皮三錢("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"經過傷口可以活血化瘀"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":") 白芍五錢("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"腹痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":") "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三付"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6 → 2 碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚餐前各一碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說： \n1.大腸癌只要宿便能排出即能治好;用承氣湯清一段時間後,肛門脹滿感消失後即癒 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2.外痔大便完後擦肛門時會有血，先便後血；內痔是先血後便"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3.大腸癌腫瘤常頂住近肛門處，大便無血 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"4.下焦之陽源頭來自心陽，心陽還在只是下焦寒就用炮附子。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註：會致便秘的食物都不能吃-\u0026gt;燒烤,辛辣"}]}]}]}]}